{"parse": {"title": "三重赋格-02", "pageid": 110906, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-01\" title=\"三重赋格-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">三重赋格-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-03\" title=\"三重赋格-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">三重赋格</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9D.A5.E8.87.AA.E8.BF.87.E5.8E.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"来自过去\">来自过去</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 来自过去</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">From the Past</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你为什么不愿意回答我的问题？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我只是还在理解这个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>怎么？我成为战地护士让你非常惊讶？以至于你连句完整的话都说不出来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>抱歉，我的确很惊讶，我已经很久没有你和你哥哥的消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我哥？他的右腿被炸伤，移送到后方医院，然后死在了我面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……我很抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>没什么好抱歉的，你也是个士兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你为什么要来前线？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我想知道瓦尔特是怎么死的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……帕蒂塔，在战场上寻找一个人的死因是毫无意义的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>一个人的死因不该毫无意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性的发言使得卡戎停滞半晌，他艰难地组织着语言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>虽然我不知道你来了多久，但你的确是一名战地护士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你应该知道，在火炮、机枪和坦克面前，人的生命脆弱且渺小，以至于不值一提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>瓦尔特死于一枚炮弹，但还有许多人甚至只能被标记上失踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>所以我更愿意相信你刚刚对我说的“寻找瓦尔特死因”只是一种敷衍，它不会有答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>这不是一种敷衍，你知道我从不敷衍你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>总是敷衍我和瓦尔特，总是回避问题，总是装作若无其事的人是你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你在生气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你为什么不回家？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无法回答的问题也必须被找到一个答案，即使是临时的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我不知道现在的我该怎么回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我们需要你，不管是过去的你还是现在的你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你为什么不回家看看你的妈妈和姐姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>看看已经失去瓦尔特的我们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……帕蒂塔，我真的不是不想回答你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>那么，瓦尔特死在你面前，你来告诉我，是什么样的炮击？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你看过我的笔记本了，你应该已经知道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>那上面只有瓦尔特死去的日期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>那就是一次炮击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你为什么要撕掉后半页？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的眼神黯淡下去，随后发出一声短促的冷笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我真是受够了，保罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我看着哥哥死在我面前，他是自杀的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎无法想象那个独自抚养妹妹长大的人会自杀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔的目光更像一种轻蔑，但被轻蔑对待的或许是她自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>伤口感染后的他就像在凌迟重辟的疼痛里，等待死刑的那一次落刀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我没能留下他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>这不是你的错，我们都尽力了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我哥死后一周，你写信说瓦尔特死了，那封信是寄到他家里的，我一路跑着去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>那天下着雨，我摔了一跤。我接过信的时候以为那是瓦尔特的血，但其实是我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……帕蒂塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>即使瓦尔特没有死在我面前……我也不知道我为什么要……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>要愚蠢地、可笑地、令人厌烦地寻求他的死因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>甚至连你都在不断地回避我、否定我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我并不是想要否定或回避你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>帕蒂塔，你可以找到你真正想做，或者你真正该做的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我就是找不到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>还有四天，这里的野战医院就会撤离，到时候，护士们会有一次轮换。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你可以回家，瓦尔特和你哥哥肯定也希望你远离前线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你本该与战争无关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>这场战争已经和我们每个人息息相关！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>还没站在这里的时候，我的过去和未来就已经死了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他没有承接她痛苦的能力。他站在那里，连消化这份痛苦都显得无比艰难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默之中，女性的目光终于还是变为了无奈的自嘲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我们的谈论毫无意义，只是在把废墟变得更像废墟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>回你该去的地方吧，保罗，我似乎不该占用一名士官这么多时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>抱歉，帕蒂塔，我很抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没再看他，只是转身离去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是齿轮中卡进石子，回到战壕之后，卡戎的工作变得不再顺畅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仅仅是分辨识别牌是否被摘下，他都花了不短的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>哎，卡戎，怎么你的反应变得更慢了，还是我来帮你吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……抱歉，多谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>这就是最后一批，战壕里可算干净了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>你选的墓地离这里不算很远，要不要进来和我们玩几把斯卡特牌？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>不，打牌就不必了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>哎呀，和我们一起玩会儿牌吧，卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>你总在照顾死者，也可以试试照顾活着的，来吧来吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>不，但我可以看你们玩一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>还在找那张相片的主人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的，看起来确实有些难，不过我会四下打听的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>弗兰兹是我们连的门面，和谁都有交情，你让他问问——只要你打牌赢了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>对！只要你打牌赢了他！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>得了吧！你们这群家伙一肚子坏水，你们就是想赢走卡戎的补给。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我的补给？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>比起我们，你可是几乎二十四小时都在战场上搜罗破烂啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我是想体面地埋葬士兵的遗体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>我知道，但是你经常捡到那些东西吧？卷烟、绷带、降落伞的绸布……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>我们真的很需要这些东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>说实话，叫我拿枚勋章和你换补给也是可以的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>哎，弗兰兹，可别让连长听见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>艾伯哈特才不管这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个轻且缓的动作，几包卷烟已经被叠在了射击台上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我可以直接给你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗兰兹吹了一声悠长的口哨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>天哪，这就是和卡戎关系不错的好处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>只是，我希望你们可以试着帮我找到这张相片的主人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>这倒真用不着，即使你不给我们这些，我们也会替你找的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>的确，刚刚那是想找你打牌开的玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>好，我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>不过，四天后野战医院要撤离了，你知道这个事情吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我的确知道……对，你的休假日是不是快到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵的脸上露出了几缕少见的轻快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>对，我会护送撤离的队伍到后方，然后回去休假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>在那之前，我会尽量帮你找相片的主人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>好的，谢谢你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>还有，明天我会抽空来帮你安葬士兵。先说好，不要拒绝，也不要说谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……谢谢你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>如果不是了解你，我真的会以为你的这句谢谢是个挑衅。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "三重赋格-02"}}